# Baseline log tails: www test audit pilot, Phase 1 task 1.1

Two commands ran through the shared runner with HEAVY_PREFLIGHT_WAIT_S=3600.
Both exited 0. Both report 91 test files and 3175 test cases passing.
The coverage run needed no extra flag: it finished without OOM, so no
`-- --maxWorkers=1` was added.

## 1. Vitest run (GREEN_TEST_COMMAND)

Command: CI=true pnpm --filter www-reading-advantage exec vitest run
--maxWorkers=1 --reporter=dot

Tail (verbatim):

```
 Test Files  91 passed (91)
      Tests  3175 passed (3175)
   Start at  16:52:12
   Duration  90.47s (transform 1.33s, setup 4.25s, import 8.62s, tests 32.00s, environment 37.01s)
```

Result: exit 0. case_count=3175, files=91, status pass.
Wall time of the test run: test_wall_seconds=90.47.

