Note: the coverage output lists RolldownError parse failures for Thai
blog `.md` files while remapping V8 coverage. Those files are not
JavaScript. The provider excludes them from coverage and continues.
The suite still reports 3175 passed with exit 0, so the errors are
remap noise, not test failures.
